   "t": "<FACE:59>Waaaaaaah!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0058:03C5",
   "src": "b5abff4accae",
   "t": "<FACE:00>But the otaku group<NL>already reformed…<WAIT><FACE:00>Then who on earth?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0058:03E7",
   "src": "6b04d60eae61",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>Miss Ki-ri-kaaaa-robo!<NL><WAIT>We're melting-robo!"
