  {
   "key": "script:0058:0406",
   "src": "344b54aad53c",
   "t": "<FACE:74>…heheh…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0058:0410",
   "src": "4ae0b4042390",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Hey, you!<NL>What's wrong-robo?!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0058:0423",
   "src": "cf1c49f0061c",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Th-this isn't why I<NL>joined the gang-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0058:044B",
   "src": "ac9679d11489",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>How's this conquering<NL>the universe-robo?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0058:046E",
   "src": "11bb4c2b7a7e",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Can't help it-robo…<NL><WAIT>Ever since that whole<NL>otaku group business<WAIT>I got hooked on the<NL>cheering-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0058:04A9",
   "src": "ced9515fef19",
   "t": "<FACE:05>…So you want that<NL>dream one more time?<WAIT>Is that why you took<NL>this Block back too?"
